    /// Every variant, in DECLARATION order, so `ALL[k as usize] == k`
    /// for every `k` — the enum is fieldless and carries no explicit
    /// discriminants, so a variant's `as usize` IS its position here.
    ///
    /// Enables exhaustive iteration over the vocabulary, and a total
    /// index → kind mapping for callers that encode a kind positionally.
    /// POSITIONAL, therefore NOT stable across grammar revisions: a kind
    /// added mid-alphabet shifts every later index. Anything persisting an
    /// index must key on the grammar identity too (`src/program/pack`
    /// relies on `crates/` being inside the pack fingerprint closure).
